   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>Fiilde çatı özelliği yalnızca <b>yüklemi çekimli fiil</b> olan cümlelerde aranır; yüklemi isim soylu sözcük veya ek-fiil almış fiilimsi olan cümlelerde çatı özelliği aranmaz. Aşağıdaki tanılayıcı dallanmış ağaçta sorular doğru yanıtlanarak bir çıkışa ulaşılacaktır.</p>\n<div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 196\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Fiilde çatı tanılayıcı dallanmış ağaç\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n<rect x=\"70\" y=\"6\" width=\"420\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"280\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1. Cümle: “Başarının en temel anahtarı düzenli çalışmaktır.”</text>\n<text x=\"280\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Bu cümlede çatı özelliği aranır mı?</text>\n<line x1=\"200\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"72\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"360\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"72\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"162\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" text-anchor=\"end\">Aranır</text>\n<text x=\"398\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#15803d\">Aranmaz</text>\n<rect x=\"5\" y=\"72\" width=\"270\" height=\"56\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#2563eb\"/>\n<text x=\"140\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2. Cümle:</text>\n<text x=\"140\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">“Bahçedeki çiçekler sabah sulandı.”</text>\n<text x=\"140\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e40af\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Öznesine göre çatısı nedir?</text>\n<rect x=\"285\" y=\"72\" width=\"270\" height=\"56\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#d97706\"/>\n<text x=\"420\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3. Cümle:</text>\n<text x=\"420\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">“Kardeşim sınav sonuçlarına çok sevindi.”</text>\n<text x=\"420\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#92400e\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Öznesine göre çatısı nedir?</text>\n<line x1=\"80\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"200\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"360\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"480\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"64\" y=\"148\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\" text-anchor=\"end\">Etken</text>\n<text x=\"217\" y=\"148\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">Edilgen</text>\n<text x=\"344\" y=\"148\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\" text-anchor=\"end\">Etken</text>\n<text x=\"497\" y=\"148\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">Edilgen</text>\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"160\" width=\"80\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"179\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1. Çıkış</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"160\" width=\"80\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#d97706\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"179\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2. Çıkış</text>\n<rect x=\"300\" y=\"160\" width=\"80\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"179\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3. Çıkış</text>\n<rect x=\"460\" y=\"160\" width=\"80\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><text x=\"500\" y=\"179\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4. Çıkış</text>\n</svg></div>\n<p>Şemadaki sorular doğru yanıtlanarak ilerlendiğinde <b>kaçıncı çıkışa</b> ulaşılır?</p>",
